<ProductLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogImage="/images/flaxseed-gum-5-1024x1024.jpg" gallery={gallery} category={category} price={price} related={related} descriptionHtml={`<h2><strong>Statement</strong></h2><p><span style="color: #ff6600;">This <strong>Flaxseed Gum Powder</strong> contains <strong>55% gum content</strong>, which differs from <strong>pure flaxseed gum</strong> (over 90% purity) with its off-white color. <strong>To achieve the same thickening and stabilizing effects, please use twice the amount</strong> compared to pure flaxseed gum.</span></p><hr/><h2><strong>Product Features</strong></h2><ol><li><strong>Pure Physical Milling Process</strong><ul><li>Produced through <strong>physical milling</strong>, without chemical solvent extraction, ensuring <strong>no chemical residues</strong> and <strong>100% natural flaxseed composition</strong>.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Classified as a Food Ingredient</strong><ul><li>Also known as <strong>flaxseed powder</strong>, it is classified as a <strong>food ingredient</strong> rather than a food additive.</li><li>For customs declaration, it should be reported as <strong>flaxseed powder</strong> rather than flaxseed gum.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Sourced from Local Chinese Inner Mongolia Flaxseed Shells</strong><ul><li>Made from <strong>high-quality flaxseed shells from Inner Mongolia, China</strong>, processed purely through physical methods.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Cost-Effective Alternative</strong><ul><li>The price is approximately <strong>one-third of pure flaxseed gum</strong>, making it a more <strong>affordable and practical choice</strong>.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Gluten-Free &amp; Non-GMO</strong><ul><li><strong>Gluten-free</strong>, suitable for those with gluten intolerance.</li><li><strong>Non-GMO</strong>, meeting global health food trends.</li></ul></li></ol><hr/><h2><strong>Applications &amp; Usage Instructions</strong></h2